"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达拟向Ilya Sutskever创办的SSI投资50亿美元深化算力合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达计划向OpenAI联合创始人Ilya Sutskever创立的AI实验室Safe Superintelligence Inc.（SSI）投资50亿美元，双方已达成长期合作协议。此次合作旨在深化AI算力与模型研发布局，SSI未来将大规模采用英伟达旗舰GPU硬件，预计其AI训练算力规模将提升一个数量级。此前，SSI主要依赖谷歌TPU进行模型训练，此次引入英伟达GPU资源将为其基础模型训练及安全超级智能研发提供更强算力支持。SSI于2024年成立，此前曾完成20亿美元融资，估值达320亿美元。英伟达此次加码投资，标志着其正从单纯的AI芯片供应商向AI生态核心投资者转型，通过深度绑定头部AI实验室，进一步巩固其在下一代人工智能基础设施领域的战略地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面正式开源Kimi K3模型权重，参数规模达2.8万亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面正式将Kimi K3模型权重上传至Hugging Face并同步发布技术报告。该模型总参数量为2.8万亿，激活参数1040亿，支持100万token上下文，是全球首个进入3万亿参数级别的开放权重模型。K3在Artificial Analysis智能指数中位列全球第三，并在前端编程竞技场Arena以1679分登顶。随权重发布的Kimi K3 License包含特殊商业条款：年收入超2000万美元的第三方推理或微调服务主体需另签协议，月活超1亿或月收入超2000万美元的商业产品须标注“Kimi K3”。API定价为输入3美元/百万token、输出15美元/百万token。此举旨在限制云厂商“搭便车”行为，同时通过差异化定价与协议约束，重塑大模型商业化竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三星电子与博通达成长期合作，预计2030年AI芯片业务规模超2000亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ba94e005fbe2a3c3e84778fe58e385e3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三星电子与博通正式达成长期深度合作协议，双方将围绕内存芯片、代工制造及先进封装展开全链条协作，预计到2030年相关业务合作规模将突破2000亿美元。此次合作核心在于将博通的ASIC定制芯片设计能力与三星的先进制造工艺深度整合，博通下一代通信芯片将采用三星sub-2纳米制程生产。此外，双方正联合研发下一代HBM，旨在解决AI模型参数膨胀带来的内存带宽瓶颈。对三星而言，该协议不仅巩固了其在代工市场的竞争地位，更通过HBM4E与HBM5等技术布局，强化了制造全流程的协同效能。此举标志着AI芯片产业正从通用GPU模式转向“设计+制造”深度耦合的定制化阶段，芯片、内存与封装的协同将成为决定硬件性能上限的关键引擎。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Similarweb报告：谷歌AI概览出现率升至43%，AI搜索重塑流量格局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/584b6e21db16796ad4dde3668af99b45.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Similarweb最新报告显示，谷歌AI概览（AI Overviews）在搜索结果中的出现比例已从一年前的15%激增至43%，标志着AI搜索正成为主流信息获取入口。数据显示，谷歌AI模式访问量从2025年6月的1.26亿次增长至2026年5月的2.79亿次，用户搜索习惯已从关键词搜索转向更自然的对话式查询。这一趋势正重塑互联网流量分配，传统出版商面临AI摘要导致点击率下降的挑战，尽管AI引用数量增长超5倍，但并不直接等同于流量转化。不过，AI搜索生态也在演进，ChatGPT在5月7日更新搜索功能后，其带来的网页推荐流量占比已从25%提升至近60%。行业分析指出，谷歌正从网页导航工具转型为信息消费平台，内容生产者需优化内容结构以提升AI可见性，适应AI驱动的新型流量分发机制。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic Claude Cowork爆沙箱逃逸漏洞，50万macOS用户面临文件读写风险</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6314dca4e5e2a5e21fc3da983dc11f43.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">安全研究人员发现Anthropic旗下AI智能体工具Claude Cowork存在严重安全漏洞，攻击者可利用CVE-2026-46331（代号pedit COW）Linux内核漏洞，从虚拟机沙箱逃逸并获取宿主机文件系统读写权限，潜在影响全球约50万macOS用户。该漏洞通过VirtioFS挂载点突破了虚拟机隔离与用户授权的双层防线，使智能体能以root权限访问Mac本地资源及在线服务凭据。Anthropic目前未发布直接补丁，仅通过更新版本将任务执行默认迁移至云端以绕过本地路径。对于选择继续在本地运行Claude Cowork的用户，官方建议通过禁用非特权用户命名空间、限制文件系统共享及使用严格挂载保护来强化系统配置。此事件凸显了AI智能体本地执行模式下，底层虚拟机隔离机制与用户权限边界的安全性挑战。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
